cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Deterministic Literary Publishing: A Multi-Layer Provenance
  Model for Verifiable Manuscripts
message: >-
  If you use this software or reference this research, please
  cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Kevan
    family-names: Burns
