    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-8425-939X
repository-code: https://github.com/FTHTrading/2500-donkeys
url: https://xxxiii.io
abstract: >-
  A multi-layer provenance architecture for literary publishing
  that replaces institutional trust with cryptographic verification.
  The system combines Merkle tree hashing across multiple content
  categories, content-addressed storage (IPFS), deterministic build
  pipelines, and append-only blockchain records to produce a
  five-layer verification stack. Formalized as the Literary Protocol
  Standard (LPS-1) and validated through two literary works — a
  75,000-word novel and a 13-story short fiction collection —
  demonstrating protocol generalization across formats, TTS engines,
  and tree topologies. Deployed across five smart contracts on
  Polygon mainnet.
keywords:
